# Cairn live ISO package list — installed into the live environment only.
# (The *target* system's list is scripts/installer/target-packages.x86_64.)
#
# Forked from archiso's releng profile. Last synced with archiso 90:
#   /usr/share/archiso/configs/releng/packages.x86_64
#
# Re-sync after an archiso upgrade, then update the version above:
#   diff <(sed '/^[[:blank:]]*#/d;/^[[:blank:]]*$/d' profile/packages.x86_64) \
#        <(sort /usr/share/archiso/configs/releng/packages.x86_64)
#
# Deltas from releng 90: none — the set below is identical to upstream's.
# When Cairn intentionally adds or drops a package, list it here with the
# reason so the next re-sync doesn't silently undo the decision.
#
# Historical note: broadcom-wl was dropped (from releng too) when it left the
# official repos; only broadcom-wl-dkms remains, which would need dkms +
# linux-headers in the ISO. airootfs/etc/modprobe.d/broadcom-wl.conf stays,
# matching releng.
#
# mkarchiso strips '#' comments and blank lines from this file before pacstrap.

